{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_154_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_154","textTraditional":"一、四年。春王三月己酉，陳侯午卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_154_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_154","textTraditional":"二、夏，叔孫豹如晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_154_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_154","textTraditional":"三、秋七月戊子，夫人弋氏薨。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_154_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_154","textTraditional":"四、葬陳成公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_154_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_154","textTraditional":"五、八月辛亥，葬我小君定弋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_154_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_154","textTraditional":"定弋者，襄公之母也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_154_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_154","textTraditional":"六、冬，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_154_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_154","textTraditional":"七、陳人圍頓。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}